<title>USA: R-B says acquires Peerless Industrial.</title>
<headline>R-B says acquires Peerless Industrial.</headline>
<dateline>BARRINGTON, Ill. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>R-B Capital Corp said it acquired control of Peerless Industrial Group Inc.</p>
<p>R-B said its cash tender offer for all Peerless shares expired May 15. More than six million Peerless common and Class B shares, represented 97.1-percent of the total outstanding, were tendered and accepted, R-B said.</p>
<p>R-B said it will pay $1.67 for each share of Peerless that was not purchased in the tender offer.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
